OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering cloud and drizzle tends to
OL,7,Fclear, with a chillier night than
OL,8,FTuesday night allowing for the odd
OL,9,Fmist, fog and frost patch to form in
OL,10,Frural areas by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAfter any mist clears,
OL,13,FThursday will be dry with plenty of
OL,14,Fautumnal sunshine. Winds ease
OL,15,Fovernight but it will feel cold for
OL,16,Fthe time of year with a widespread
OL,17,Ffrost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
